    cfa:inDomain dom:MI ;
    cfa:isEvidencedBy val:keysource-Interpretation_Context ;
    cfa:positionBasis "standards silent, open" ;
    cfa:positionBasisNote "Interpretation_Context in Domain_Behaviour: COSMoS has MILAT on 1 of 8 MI DSSs (value list on 1; COSMoS_Use never assigned); it never separates the DSSs of one BC (not in Variable_Evidence); codelist LAT (C99073). SDTMIG v3.4 Variable Qualifier, Perm. SDTM v2.0: Variable Qualifier of --SPEC, --LOC. SDTMIG v3.4 CDISC Notes: 'Qualifier for laterality of the location of the specimen in MILOC. Examples: \"LEFT\", \"RIGHT\", \"BILATERAL\".' No source says whether this variable is part of the observable. Kind: observable — qualifies the specimen and the location (SDTM v2.0), and takes their kind." ;
    cfa:positionStatus "proposed" .

