    cfa:positionBasisNote "Interpretation_Context in Domain_Behaviour: COSMoS has MBLOC on 3 of 14 MB DSSs (value list on 3; COSMoS_Use never assigned); it never separates the DSSs of one BC (not in Variable_Evidence); codelist LOC (C74456). SDTMIG v3.4 Record Qualifier, Perm. SDTM v2.0: Record Qualifier. SDTMIG v3.4 CDISC Notes: 'Anatomical location relevant to the collection of the measurement.' No source says whether this variable is part of the observable. Kind: observable — the anatomical location where what is determined is collected or measured; with --SPEC it says what is examined (SDTM v2.0: --LAT and --DIR qualify --SPEC and --LOC together)." ;
